# fyp_flutter/Dockerfile only needs build/web (36 MB) and nginx.conf, but build/
# as a whole is 1.2 GB (build/app alone is ~1 GB of Android artifacts) and
# .dart_tool another 88 MB. Deny-by-default, then allow the two things it copies.
#
# NOTE: build/web is committed to git on purpose — this image does not run
# `flutter build web`. Do not add build/web to .gitignore.
*
!build/web
!nginx.conf
